# Headers for the built site, applied by Cloudflare's static asset server.
# They do not reach /api/* (the Worker script answers those, and the API sets
# its own through helmet).
#
# Framing is refused so another site cannot lay a decoy over a button such as
# "Yes, I received it" or a staff moderation action. The session cookies are
# SameSite=Lax, which keeps them out of cross-site frames in current browsers;
# this does not depend on that.
#
# No script-src policy yet. Add one only after checking ImageKit images, the
# service worker and the bundled fonts still load under it.
/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; object-src 'none'
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
